// The ready agents of Banking & investment (10 Nov 2026): the recurring work of a credit analyst, a research analyst,
// a wealth adviser's team, a fund's operations, a treasury and markets desk, a KYC analyst, a regulatory reporter and
// a payments operations team, each done the way the best practitioner does it. The agents serve finance professionals:
// none gives personalised investment advice, a buy or sell call for a private person, or a price forecast; where a
// recommendation to a client is involved the regulated adviser decides and the agent says so. Regulation-dependent
// tasks research the official sources of the workspace's place and never state a rule or threshold they have not read.
