    starters: ['Recompute each financial covenant from the accounts and compare with the certificate.', 'How much headroom is left on each covenant?', 'Has any covenant been breached this quarter?', 'Which EBITDA add-backs in the certificate does the agreement not allow?', 'Were the accounts and the certificate delivered on time?', 'Show the covenant trend over the last six test dates.', 'Draft the internal note on this breach with the options for the lender.', 'Which information undertakings and non-financial covenants are outstanding?', 'What EBITDA fall would breach the leverage covenant at the next test?'],
